      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "tool_uses": [],
      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is injected **into the environment of the spawned child process**, immediately before that process starts. Specifically:\n\n- A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n- The key is injected only into the environment of the child process (whether the Ingest agent or Query agent)\n- The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated or holds the key\n\nThis design ensures that a compromised Hub process cannot leak the credential by inspecting its own environment variables \u2014 the key exists only inside the short-lived child process that actually needs it to call the Anthropic API.",
